stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Empty
    Empty --> EconomyWithStandard: add standard
    Empty --> EconomyWithVip: add VIP
    Empty --> PremiumWithVip: add VIP to premium
    Empty --> Empty: add standard to premium / reject
    EconomyWithStandard --> Empty: remove standard
    EconomyWithVip --> EconomyWithVip: remove VIP / reject
    PremiumWithVip --> PremiumWithVip: duplicate / reject
